  <p>
    A flat list of "things home science graduates can do" is not useful on its own.
  </p>

  <p>
    What matters more is which tracks have real room to scale your income and which ones are structurally capped — so the order below is not alphabetical or based on prestige. It is ranked by how much realistic growth headroom each track actually has, with the reason stated plainly for each one.
  </p>

