      Notice that the top three tracks all share one thing: a real ownership path sitting on top of the salaried option.
    </p>
    <p>
      A food brand, a nutrition practice, and a design label are not side hustles here — they are the biggest reason those three tracks outrank the others on long-term ceiling.
    </p>
  </div>

